{"_id":"68a736358ec3d8323af1da41","nodeId":"7YKWYxogJq6X35IAUwcZF","roadmapSlug":"rust","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:32.844Z","description":"# Debugging\n\nRust provides excellent debugging support through `rust-gdb` and `rust-lldb` debuggers, along with built-in macros like `println!`, `dbg!`, and `debug!`. The strict compiler catches many bugs at compile-time, while runtime debugging is enhanced by panic backtraces and comprehensive error messages.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Debugging Rust apps with GDB","url":"https://blog.logrocket.com/debugging-rust-apps-with-gdb/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdd1a"},{"type":"article","title":"Rust Debugging: Easy Guide with Practical Examples","url":"https://boxoflearn.com/rust-debugging-guide/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdd1b"},{"type":"article","title":"Testing and Debugging in Rust","url":"https://rustmeup.com/testing-and-debugging-in-rust","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdd1c"},{"type":"article","title":"Mastering Rust Debugging: Tips & Tools","url":"https://medium.com/@AlexanderObregon/rust-debugging-strategies-tools-and-best-practices-b18b92e0a921","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdd1d"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:07:02.070Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/rust/content/7YKWYxogJq6X35IAUwcZF.md"}